These payloads are hand-written from the shapes pinned in tests/unit/providers/capture.rs
(_recorded: false). They were not captured from a live provider run.
T3 hosts Claude Code, so t3/ended.json mirrors the Claude Code shape with reason "other". A live run
confirmed that T3 fires SessionEnd when a thread is closed (archived), not when a turn finishes.
OpenCode has no ended.json: it has no session-end event.
